   <Text tag="[SPELL00_NAME]">Heal</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL00_DESC]">All of your units on the map are restored to full health (not castable in combat).</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL01_NAME]">Paladin</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL01_DESC]">Summons a level 3 Knight with the Heal +1 skill.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL02_NAME]">Inspiration</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL02_DESC]">Adds +3 to Morale for the duration of the spell.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL03_NAME]">Holy Weapon</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL03_DESC]">All of your heroes gain Smite Evil +4 in the next combat.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL04_NAME]">Prosperity</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL04_DESC]">All cities gain +10 Gold to their income.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL05_NAME]">Holy Armor</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL05_DESC]">All good units gain Armor +2 in the next combat.</Text>

   <Text tag="[SPELL06_NAME]">Disrupt Undead</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL06_DESC]">Destroys all low/mid level Undead near the spell&apos;s origin.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL07_NAME]">Summon Unicorn</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL07_DESC]">Summons a powerful Unicorn to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL08_NAME]">Endurance</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL08_DESC]">All of your troops gain +4 Movement at the start of every turn.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL09_NAME]">Justice</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL09_DESC]">Doubles experience points from the next combat.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL10_NAME]">Tranquility</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL10_DESC]">All Necromantic and Summoning Enchantments and Battle Spells are dispelled.</Text>

   <Text tag="[SPELL11_NAME]">Archangel</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL11_DESC]">Summons a high-level Archon to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL12_NAME]">Resurrection</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL12_DESC]">The last hero slain (from any side, not just your own) will be resurrected in your current group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL13_NAME]">Holy Word</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL13_DESC]">Destroys all low/mid/high level Undead and Daemons near the spell&apos;s origin.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL14_NAME]">Divine Grace</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL14_DESC]">All creatures gain +25% life when produced.</Text>

   <Text tag="[SPELL15_NAME]">Shield</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL15_DESC]">All infantry gain Armor +2 in the next combat.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL16_NAME]">Dispel</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL16_DESC]">All Nature and Summoning Enchantments and Battle Spells are dispelled.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL17_NAME]">Create Golem</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL17_DESC]">Summons a powerful Golem to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL18_NAME]">Strength</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL18_DESC]">All monsters gain +5 Combat Skill in the next battle.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL19_NAME]">Pathfinding</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL19_DESC]">All groups of units treat all terrain as if it were plains.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL20_NAME]">Storm</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL20_DESC]">Enemy fliers are at -5 Combat Skill in the next battle.</Text>

   <Text tag="[SPELL21_NAME]">Summon Giant</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL21_DESC]">Summons a powerful Rock Giant to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL22_NAME]">Flame Blade</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL22_DESC]">Infantry gain Fire +2 in the next battle.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL23_NAME]">Earthpower</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL23_DESC]">While this spell is in effect, all Towers gain +12 Life and do +2 damage.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL24_NAME]">Doomstones</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL24_DESC]">All monsters gain Crushing Blow +3 in the next battle.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL25_NAME]">Slow</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL25_DESC]">All enemies are at -3 movement while this spell lasts.</Text>

   <Text tag="[SPELL26_NAME]">Colossus</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL26_DESC]">Summons a very powerful Elemental to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL27_NAME]">Shatter</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL27_DESC]">Destroys all items carried by enemies (excluding artifacts) near the spell&apos;s origin.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL28_NAME]">Meteor Storm</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL28_DESC]">All units out in the open, near the spell&apos;s origin, take 10-18 points of damage.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL29_NAME]">Earthquake</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL29_DESC]">All level 2 and 3 cities near the spell&apos;s origin drop to level 1.</Text>

   <Text tag="[SPELL30_NAME]">Unholy Blade</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL30_DESC]">All heroes gain Smite Good +4 in the next battle.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL31_NAME]">Summon Liche</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL31_DESC]">Summons a powerful Liche to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL32_NAME]">Unholy Armor</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL32_DESC]">All evil creatures gain Armor +2 in the next battle.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL33_NAME]">Stolen Memories</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL33_DESC]">All Evil units begin play with 8 Experience Points.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL34_NAME]">Bonedance</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL34_DESC]">Any stack containing only Undead, immediately gains +14 movement.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL35_NAME]">Phantom Steed</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL35_DESC]">All cavalry gain +2 Speed while this spell lasts.</Text>

   <Text tag="[SPELL36_NAME]">Skeleton Horde</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL36_DESC]">Summons a group of 8 Skeletons (with a leader) to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL37_NAME]">Void</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL37_DESC]">All Nature and Divine Enchantments and Battle Spells are dispelled.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL38_NAME]">Veil of Force</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL38_DESC]">All evil creatures gain Negate +2 in the next combat.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL39_NAME]">Deathplague</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL39_DESC]">All Undead gain Disease +3 while this spell lasts.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL40_NAME]">Mana Drain</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL40_DESC]">All players instantly lose 15 mana.</Text>

   <Text tag="[SPELL41_NAME]">Legion of Doom</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL41_DESC]">Summons a group of 8 Undead Riders (with a leader) to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL42_NAME]">Raise Dragon</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL42_DESC]">Summons a powerful Dragonliche with Vampirism +1 to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL43_NAME]">Blood Ritual</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL43_DESC]">All Heroes gain Vampirism +5 while this spell lasts.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL44_NAME]">Bane</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL44_DESC]">All good creatures close to the spell&apos;s origin have a 75% chance of being slain.</Text>

   <Text tag="[SPELL45_NAME]">Banish</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL45_DESC]">This spell has a 50% chance to destroy any level 1 Daemons near the spell&apos;s origin.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL46_NAME]">Summon Imps</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL46_DESC]">Summons a group of 3 Imps to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL47_NAME]">Souleater</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL47_DESC]">Summons a powerful Soul Gatherer to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL48_NAME]">Hellfire</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL48_DESC]">All evil creatures gain Fire +2 in the next combat.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL49_NAME]">Fireward</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL49_DESC]">All Daemons gain Warding +4 in the next combat.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL50_NAME]">Ring of Fire</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL50_DESC]">All enemy units near the spell&apos;s origin suffer 4-8 points of damage.</Text>

   <Text tag="[SPELL51_NAME]">Soulharvest</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL51_DESC]">Summons a group of 4 Soul Gatherers to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL52_NAME]">Planar Rift</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL52_DESC]">All Rune and Divine Enchantments and Battle Spells are dispelled.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL53_NAME]">Recall</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL53_DESC]">Recalls your most powerful hero (and his troops) to your capital city.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL54_NAME]">Visage</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL54_DESC]">All Heroes gain Terror +5 in the next battle.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL55_NAME]">Pyrohydra</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL55_DESC]">Summons a high-level Hydra with a bonus Fire skill to the current city or group.</Text>

   <Text tag="[SPELL56_NAME]">Doombat</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL56_DESC]">Summons a group of 8 powerful Giant Bats to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL57_NAME]">Daemon Prince</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL57_DESC]">Summons a high-level Daemonic Hero to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL58_NAME]">Gate</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL58_DESC]">Summons a group of 8 Daemon Minions (with a leader) to the current city or group.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL59_NAME]">Flame of Khazdhul</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL59_DESC]">All your heroes gain Curse +5.</Text>

   <Text tag="[SPELL60_NAME]">Growth</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL60_DESC]">All cities receive an extra turn of production.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL61_NAME]">Bounty</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL61_DESC]">Income increases by +100 Gold per turn while this spell lasts.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL62_NAME]">Herbalism</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL62_DESC]">All heroes gain Healing +5 in the next combat.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL63_NAME]">Blessing of Iris</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL63_DESC]">All of your heroes gain Bless +2 while this spell lasts.</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL64_NAME]">Venom</Text>
   <Text tag="[SPELL64_DESC]">All monsters gain Poison +5 in their next battle.</Text>
